&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are looking for an&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Electrical&amp;nbsp;Integration Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;to join our rapidly growing team in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Costa Mesa, CA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;. In this role, you will work closely with avionics, systems,&amp;nbsp;manufacturing,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;flight test teams&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;support the&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;and test of air vehicle designs.&amp;nbsp;If you are someone who thrives in a fast-paced environment supporting new developments, active deployments, and customer operated hardware, we are looking for you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
