&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POSITION SUMMARY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Sales Application Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to support our sales teams and customers across the &lt;strong&gt;Western U.S.&lt;/strong&gt; Ideally, this individual will be based in the&lt;strong&gt; Pacific Northwest (Washington, Oregon, or California), Colorado, Nevada, Arizona, New Mexico, or Utah.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will serve as a key partner to both our commercial and customer teams, helping drive the adoption and success of Natera&#39;s digital care optimization solutions. You&#39;ll work cross-functionally with Sales, EHR, Product, Operations, customers, and vendor partners to support solution presentations, manage implementations, optimize workflows, and ensure successful customer outcomes. This is a highly collaborative role that combines customer-facing engagement, project management, analytics, and healthcare technology expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PRIMARY RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in selling, managing implementations, running analytics, and monitoring account growth following project go-lives to ensure the care optimizations are implemented correctly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide field support for existing accounts where digital care optimizations have been implemented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own project timelines, risks, dependencies, and stakeholder communication throughout implementation and post-go-live optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Key tasks includes
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Sales Team on new care optimization requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run reports on existing implementations and provide metrics for account reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate projects with internal support teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide training and on-site customer support for new implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify existing issues or opportunities for improvement with customer EHR interfaces and provide feedback to clients, vendors, EHR team, Sales and Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze EHR utilization data and work with clients to increase electronic order volumes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with EHR team on key initiatives and product updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other duties as assigned&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role works with PHI on a regular basis both in paper and electronic form and has access to various technologies to access PHI (paper and electronic) in order to perform the job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee must complete training relating to HIPAA/PHI privacy, General Policies and Procedure&amp;nbsp;Compliance&amp;nbsp;training and security training as soon as possible but not later than the first 30&amp;nbsp;days of hire&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must maintain a current status on Natera training requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee must pass post-offer criminal background check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree or an Associate’s Degree required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 2 years of relevant related experience, preferably in the medical field or laboratory space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have knowledge of EHR systems, clinic and lab workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Epic EHR analyst experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KNOWLEDGE, SKILLS, AND ABILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional customer service skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be comfortable and proficient presenting to accounts virtually and in person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivation, with the desire and capacity to work both independently and collaboratively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extreme attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Endless curiosity and a need to dive deeper for understanding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent listening skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple concurrent projects and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consultative problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting to executive and operational stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret data and translate insights into actionable recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and ability to understand both technical and functional details of projects/requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running reports and monitoring accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PHYSICAL DEMANDS &amp;amp; WORK ENVIRONMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The duties are performed in a field / remote setting and also require the use of a computer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Duties might sometimes require working outside of normal working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requires travel up to 70%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Total Rewards&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;This range reflects a good-faith estimate of the base pay we reasonably&amp;nbsp;expect to offer at the time of&amp;nbsp; hire.&amp;nbsp;Final compensation will vary based on experience, qualifications, and internal equity considerations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;This position&amp;nbsp;is also eligible for additional compensation and benefits through&amp;nbsp;Natera’s robust Total Rewards program, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Annual performance incentive bonus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Long-term equity awards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health benefits (medical, dental, vision)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;401(k) with company match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Generous paid time off and company holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Additional wellness and work-life benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Compensation Range &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$79,300&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$119,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
