&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is looking for a compassionate and dedicated Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) to join our team in our Greenville Visits office. This part time position services our adult and geriatric clients on a per visit basis in homes throughout Greenville, Anderson, Spartanburg and Pickens counties in South Carolina.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;As a home health nurse, you will be an integral member of a multi-disciplinary health care team that provides skilled nursing and rehabilitative care to clients, affording them the opportunity to receive the medical care required to remain at home.&lt;/p&gt;
