&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines, automation frameworks, and quality engineering practices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
